    fault: 'Either not shifting toward the target at all, or sliding the hips too far past the lead foot instead of turning.',
    why: 'A small shift of the hips toward the target at the start of the downswing moves the low point of the swing in front of the ball. Too little and you hit it fat; too much (a slide) and the club gets stuck behind you, causing blocks and hooks. Two sticks show you the space to work in.',
    kitAlt: 'No sticks? Two umbrellas, or two clubs stood upright in your bag and a chair, either side of your hips.',
    setup: 'Push one stick upright into the ground just outside your trail hip, and another a few centimetres outside your lead hip.',
    steps: ['Stand an upright stick just outside your trail hip and another a few centimetres outside your lead hip.',
      'Swing back and load into the trail side without pushing the back stick over.',
      'Early in the downswing, shift toward the front stick, then turn.',
      'Your lead hip can touch the front stick but never push past it.'],
    feel: ['Two walls either side of the hips.', 'Loaded into the trail side, not leaning on the stick.', 'A small shift, then a turn.', 'Turning against the front stick, not through it.'],
    sense: 'A small, early move of the hips toward the target, then the lead hip turning back and away from the front stick rather than pushing into it.',
    mistakes: [['A slow, continual drift toward the target.', 'Make it a small shift at the start of the downswing, then turn.'],
      ['Sliding through the front stick.', 'Turn your lead pocket back as soon as you feel the stick.'],
      ['Leaning the upper body back to avoid the front stick.', 'Keep your chest over the ball; the hips do the work.']],
    rx: '10 slow rehearsals, then 10 balls at three-quarter effort with the sticks in place.',
    success: ['You touch or nearly touch the front stick without pushing it.', 'The back stick stays upright.', 'Divots start at or just after the ball.'],
    progress: ['Slow rehearsals between the sticks.', 'Half shots.', 'Full shots.', 'Without sticks, checking on video face-on.'],
    note: 'How much the hips move toward the target varies between good players. Set the front stick where your own shift should stop rather than at a fixed distance.',
    view: 'face', scene: 'range', ball: true, poster: 3,
    props: [{ type: 'stick', a: [-0.33, 0, 0.0], b: [-0.33, 1.05, 0.0] }, { type: 'stick', a: [0.36, 0, 0.0], b: [0.36, 1.05, 0.0] }],
