    feel: ['A stick across your belt.', 'The upright stick behind your lead heel.', 'Lead hip turning back and out of the way.', 'Hips open, chest still over the ball.'],
    sense: 'Your lead hip turning back behind you as the club comes down, so the belt stick swings round to the upright stick while your chest is still over the ball.',
